1
00:00:00,341 --> 00:00:01,381
[SCREAMS]

2
00:00:01,551 --> 00:00:03,761
[SHELDON YELLING]

3
00:00:05,972 --> 00:00:07,262
SHELDON:
You hit me!

4
00:00:07,432 --> 00:00:08,472
[SOBBING]

5
00:00:08,641 --> 00:00:11,101
(Sheldon:)I'm bleeding!

6
00:00:12,395 --> 00:00:13,605
(Leonard:)What was that?

7
00:00:13,771 --> 00:00:16,731
(Penny:)Sheldon tried to take the ring
and I punched him.

8
00:00:17,567 --> 00:00:19,697
(Leonard:)That's my girl.

9
00:00:26,117 --> 00:00:30,327
(Howard:)So, Sheldon, how's it feel
to get beaten up by a girl?

10
00:00:33,708 --> 00:00:35,338
(Sheldon:)It's not the first time.

11
00:00:35,501 --> 00:00:38,591
(Sheldon:)I have a twin sister
whose assaults began in utero.

12
00:00:40,548 --> 00:00:43,138
(Sheldon:)If only I'd had the presence of mind
to reabsorb her.

13
00:00:43,301 --> 00:00:44,971
(Sheldon:)I'd have a mole with hair in it...

14
00:00:45,136 --> 00:00:48,266
(Sheldon:)...instead of a tedious
yearly Christmas letter.

15
00:00:48,556 --> 00:00:50,476
(Raj:)Have you come to the realization...

16
00:00:50,642 --> 00:00:54,312
...that the only reasonable action
is to sell the ring and divide the money?

17
00:00:54,604 --> 00:00:56,394
(Sheldon:)-No.
-I was afraid of that.

